# normalize line endings: the repository stores every text file with LF.
* text=auto

# the ARM64 backend snapshot fixtures are generated assembly test data, not
# authored source. excluding them keeps GitHub's language report honest (Qala
# is a Rust compiler with a TypeScript playground, not an Assembly project) and
# collapses them in diffs.
crates/qala-compiler/tests/snapshots/** linguist-generated

# the language documentation is prose, not code, so it stays out of the
# language statistics.
docs/** linguist-documentation
